ENTITIES
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

ALWAYS return "entities" as an array of plain strings — never objects, never null.
Correct: entities=["Alice", "Kubernetes", "CKA"]
Wrong:   entities as an array of objects with a "text" key ← never use this form
